
SLASH'S STORY:

Big, loud, and quick
to swing - which is
how he ended up
working the door.
Somebody giving you
trouble? Slash is
happy to help.
It's probably why
they picked him to
go outside, too.
Partly the Vault has
had its fill of him.
Mostly, nobody else
has a better shot at
walking out of the
wastes alive.